{"ep": "05", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:01.57", "end": "0:00:04.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「放学后和女生一起并肩走着回家」"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:04.18", "end": "0:00:07.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…做这种事情实在是很有种校园青春连续剧的感觉"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:07.49", "end": "0:00:11.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果说我没有梦想过这种生活  那是在说谎"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:12.19", "end": "0:00:15.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我现在正实现了那个梦想…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:16.05", "end": "0:00:18.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是一点都不高兴呐  这是怎么回事？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:19.23", "end": "0:00:20.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是那边！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:20.55", "end": "0:00:21.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你刚才说什么了么？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:22.05", "end": "0:00:23.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  什么都没有"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:29.59", "end": "0:00:32.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快到长门住的公寓了啊…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 9, "start": "0:02:03.75", "end": "0:02:06.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝仓好像是住在这里的505号室"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 10, "start": "0:02:07.10", "end": "0:02:08.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 11, "start": "0:02:08.27", "end": "0:02:09.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么原来如此？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 12, "start": "0:02:09.71", "end": "0:02:10.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  没什么"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 13, "start": "0:02:11.49", "end": "0:02:13.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是你打算怎么进去啊？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 14, "start": "0:02:14.39", "end": "0:02:16.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你知道开门用的密码么？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 15, "start": "0:02:16.49", "end": "0:02:17.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知道"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 16, "start": "0:02:17.47", "end": "0:02:19.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种时候就要靠持久战了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 17, "start": "0:02:28.31", "end": "0:02:28.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么？！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 18, "start": "0:02:31.04", "end": "0:02:32.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快点进来啦！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 19, "start": "0:02:33.18", "end": "0:02:39.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之一定有古怪  突然转学去加拿大  还是在谁都不知道的情况下"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 20, "start": "0:02:39.65", "end": "0:02:40.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是遇到了突发事件吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 21, "start": "0:02:41.16", "end": "0:02:47.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有不少奇怪的事情呢  朝仓以前好像也不是念的这市内的初中"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 22, "start": "0:02:47.49", "end": "0:02:49.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这还用说吗…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 23, "start": "0:02:49.11", "end": "0:02:53.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我还发现她是从别的县的初中越区来念北高的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 24, "start": "0:02:53.48", "end": "0:02:59.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一定有问题的吧！ 北高又不是什么名牌学校  只是一所普通县立高中"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 25, "start": "0:02:59.83", "end": "0:03:01.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么她要吃力不讨好地来念北高？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:02.06", "end": "0:03:02.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知道"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:02.77", "end": "0:03:06.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过家离学校这么近  还是住的高级公寓"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:06.88", "end": "0:03:13.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这地方位置这么好价格一定很高  难道她以前都是坐车去外县市的初中上学？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:13.79", "end": "0:03:14.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都说了不知道了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:14.99", "end": "0:03:18.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有必要调查一下朝仓是什么时候起住在这里的呢"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:18.89", "end": "0:03:21.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经是一间空房了  没可能打得开吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:22.54", "end": "0:03:25.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "抱歉了  我想这就是在浪费时间"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:26.11", "end": "0:03:27.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们去管理员室吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:27.86", "end": "0:03:30.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是我不觉得人家会把钥匙借给你啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:30.21", "end": "0:03:34.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是为了那个  我是要去问朝仓是从什么时候开始住在这里的啦！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:34.15", "end": "0:03:37.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "趁早放弃回家吧  那种东西就算知道了又能怎么样"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:38.08", "end": "0:03:38.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不行！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:39.07", "end": "0:03:43.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们是曾经住在这里的朝仓凉子同学的朋友"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:43.46", "end": "0:03:47.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她突然搬家了  连联系方式也没有留下  所以很着急呢"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 40, "start": "0:03:48.29", "end": "0:03:50.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "您可以告诉我她搬到什么地方去了吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 41, "start": "0:03:50.62", "end": "0:03:54.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有  我想问一下她是什么时候住进来的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 42, "start": "0:03:54.71", "end": "0:03:57.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来她也会用这种和常人一样的语气来提问啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 43, "start": "0:03:59.04", "end": "0:04:00.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啥～？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:00.54", "end": "0:04:05.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想问一下朝仓凉子是搬到哪里去了  还有她什么时候住进这里的！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:05.85", "end": "0:04:09.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦哦  是505室的朝仓小姐吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:09.96", "end": "0:04:15.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也没看见搬家公司来过  整个房间就空掉了  真是吓死人了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:15.86", "end": "0:04:17.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你也吓一跳吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:17.50", "end": "0:04:19.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "搬家公司没来过…？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:19.48", "end": "0:04:21.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也没听她说过要转学到哪里去啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:21.80", "end": "0:04:25.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果说一声的话要是有东西寄来的话还能帮她转寄呢"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:25.41", "end": "0:04:26.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是麻烦啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:27.27", "end": "0:04:29.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她是什么时候起住在这里的？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:29.82", "end": "0:04:32.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概三年之前吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:32.77", "end": "0:04:37.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个可爱的小姐拿了一盒和式点心送给我做见面礼  所以还记得"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 55, "start": "0:04:32.77", "end": "0:04:37.96", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（日本有搬家之后要给邻居送见面礼的习俗）"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 56, "start": "0:04:38.21", "end": "0:04:42.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她的双亲呢？您知道她的父母都是做些什么工作的吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 57, "start": "0:04:43.42", "end": "0:04:51.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔…说起来小姐经常能碰到  父母倒是完全没打过招呼呢"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 58, "start": "0:04:51.75", "end": "0:04:53.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是这座公寓很贵吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 59, "start": "0:04:54.07", "end": "0:04:58.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是让小孩子一个人住的话没必要特别去贷款买房吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 60, "start": "0:04:58.87", "end": "0:05:03.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是不是  她没用贷款  而是一口气用现金就付清了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:03.97", "end": "0:05:06.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "估计家里有钱的不得了吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:05.51", "end": "0:05:07.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这么顺利就把什么都问出来了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:07.19", "end": "0:05:08.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去改行做侦探吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:08.78", "end": "0:05:13.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "至少能道个别也好啊  真是遗憾"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:13.64", "end": "0:05:18.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  话说回来  你也满可爱的嘛"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:19.00", "end": "0:05:21.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢您亲切的回答"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:24.86", "end": "0:05:26.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "小伙子"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:27.34", "end": "0:05:30.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个小姑娘以后肯定会变成一个大美人的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:30.43", "end": "0:05:32.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别让她跑了哦"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:37.71", "end": "0:05:38.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:41.72", "end": "0:05:43.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来她也要吃饭啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:43.89", "end": "0:05:46.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "该不会你也住在这座公寓里吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 73, "start": "0:05:46.11", "end": "0:05:46.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真巧啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 74, "start": "0:05:47.06", "end": "0:05:48.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么想也不会是巧合吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 75, "start": "0:05:49.18", "end": "0:05:51.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那你有没有听说过朝仓什么事？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 76, "start": "0:05:51.88", "end": "0:05:53.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你知道她转学了吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 77, "start": "0:05:55.05", "end": "0:05:58.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是吗  如果你知道什么的话就告诉我  好吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 78, "start": "0:05:59.98", "end": "0:06:01.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的眼镜怎么了？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:03.09", "end": "0:06:05.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你看我的话会给我带来麻烦啦"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:11.39", "end": "0:06:12.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "小心"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:15.36", "end": "0:06:17.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次又要我小心些什么啊？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:18.46", "end": "0:06:19.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "走了！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:28.95", "end": "0:06:30.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来你还想要去哪里？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:31.46", "end": "0:06:32.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没什么想去的地方"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:32.64", "end": "0:06:33.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有计划吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:39.61", "end": "0:06:41.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可以回去了吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:49.15", "end": "0:06:54.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你曾经意识到过  自己在这地球上是多么渺小的存在吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:54.89", "end": "0:06:56.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你想说什么啊？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:57.23", "end": "0:06:59.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我曾经意识到过  而且永远都忘不了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 90, "start": "0:07:00.42", "end": "0:07:03.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "小学…6年级的时候"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 91, "start": "0:07:03.34", "end": "0:07:05.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我和家里人一起去看棒球赛了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 92, "start": "0:07:05.93", "end": "0:07:06.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到球场去看的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:07.49", "end": "0:07:09.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我对棒球什么的本来并不感兴趣"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:10.16", "end": "0:07:11.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但到达时我大吃一惊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:12.08", "end": "0:07:14.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能看到的地方都是人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:14.56", "end": "0:07:18.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在棒球场对面的人像米粒一样密密麻麻地挤在一起蠕动着"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:19.27", "end": "0:07:23.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "简直令人以为全日本的人一个不剩地都集中在这个空间里了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:23.36", "end": "0:07:25.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是我问了老爸"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:26.19", "end": "0:07:28.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「这里到底有多少人」"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:29.40", "end": "0:07:32.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "老爸回答我说「已经坐满了  所以大概有5万人左右吧」"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:32.76", "end": "0:07:35.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比赛结束后在去车站的路上也到处都有很多人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:36.33", "end": "0:07:38.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看到这情景  我不禁愣住了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:38.80", "end": "0:07:41.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说看起来有这么多人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:41.42", "end": "0:07:45.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但实际上就整个日本而言这仅仅是一小部分"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:45.95", "end": "0:07:48.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "回家之后我试着用计算器算了一下"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:48.56", "end": "0:07:52.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "社会课上曾经学过日本的总人口是一亿数千万"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:52.85", "end": "0:07:54.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "把这个数字除以五万之后…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:55.87", "end": "0:07:57.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "仅仅只是二千分之一"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 109, "start": "0:07:57.99", "end": "0:07:59.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我再一次愣住了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 110, "start": "0:08:00.15", "end": "0:08:04.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不过是那球场中那么多人中的一个而已"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:04.69", "end": "0:08:07.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而球场中令人觉得已经有很多的人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:07.40", "end": "0:08:09.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "却也仅仅是所有人中的一点点"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:10.67", "end": "0:08:15.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在那之前  我一直认为自己是在某一点上有特别之处的人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:15.64", "end": "0:08:17.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和家人在一起很开心"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:17.78", "end": "0:08:21.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "特别是我所上的学校  我所在的班级"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:21.16", "end": "0:08:24.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我一直认为那是由世界上最有趣的一群人组成的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:25.10", "end": "0:08:28.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是那时我终于注意到并非如此"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:29.08", "end": "0:08:32.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "班上发生的我认为是世界上最有趣的事"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:32.99", "end": "0:08:36.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也只不过是在日本各处的学校中都发生过很多遍的小事而已"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:37.58", "end": "0:08:41.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从日本全国人的角度看来只不过是很普通的事而已"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:42.23", "end": "0:08:43.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "察觉到这一点之后"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:43.77", "end": "0:08:49.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我突然觉得我周围的世界仿佛褪了色一般"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:50.36", "end": "0:08:51.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不论是晚上刷牙睡觉"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:52.42", "end": "0:08:54.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还是早晨起来吃早饭"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:54.79", "end": "0:08:59.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一想到这是到处都有的  大家都在做的日常之事"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:59.47", "end": "0:09:01.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不论什么事都会马上变得无聊起来"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 127, "start": "0:09:02.39", "end": "0:09:05.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且  我想既然世上有这么多人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 128, "start": "0:09:05.50", "end": "0:09:11.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么肯定有一些人会过着和旁人完全不同的有趣人生"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:12.32", "end": "0:09:14.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我为什么不是呢？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:15.28", "end": "0:09:19.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "直到小学毕业之前  我都一直在想这些事情"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:20.31", "end": "0:09:22.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "想着想着  我终于明白了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:22.50", "end": "0:09:25.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是等待着  有趣的事情也不会自己找上门来"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:26.02", "end": "0:09:29.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上了初中之后  我就想要改变自己了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:29.61", "end": "0:09:33.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想让全世界知道我不是只会等待的女人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:33.29", "end": "0:09:35.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而实际上我也这样做了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:35.70", "end": "0:09:37.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是结果还是什么都没有得到"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:37.99", "end": "0:09:40.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就这样  不知不觉中我成了高中生"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:41.75", "end": "0:09:44.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得自己的生活还是会有一点变化的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:54.78", "end": "0:09:56.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多亏了这班电车"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:56.53", "end": "0:10:02.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "令我得以有时间考虑现在应该吐槽\n还是应该引用一些哲学理论蒙混一下"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 141, "start": "0:10:04.14", "end": "0:10:05.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是吗"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 142, "start": "0:10:05.35", "end": "0:10:08.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "面对只能说这种话的自己  感觉很是有点忧郁"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 143, "start": "0:10:09.06", "end": "0:10:09.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回去了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 144, "start": "0:10:14.76", "end": "0:10:19.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说我也是走那边回家会比较快"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 145, "start": "0:10:19.81", "end": "0:10:24.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是春日的背影有种在无言地说着「不要跟过来」的感觉"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 146, "start": "0:10:25.28", "end": "0:10:30.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是我只得留在原地  目送春日直到看不见她的背影"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 147, "start": "0:10:31.59", "end": "0:10:33.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我到底在做什么啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:38.95", "end": "0:10:39.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:41.27", "end": "0:10:47.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想要履行前一阵子的约定  因此正在这里等你回来"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:47.56", "end": "0:10:51.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听你的口气  好像知道我刚刚去了哪里啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:51.69", "end": "0:10:54.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能否占用你一点时间呢？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:56.84", "end": "0:10:58.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "跟凉宫有关吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:58.62", "end": "0:11:00.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "跟凉宫同学有关"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 154, "start": "0:11:03.36", "end": "0:11:06.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乘电车去比起坐出租车会比较省钱吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 155, "start": "0:11:06.54", "end": "0:11:11.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之前你说过「如果你是超能力者就让我看证据」吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 156, "start": "0:11:12.33", "end": "0:11:16.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在正好有个机会  因此想让你陪我一起过去"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 157, "start": "0:11:17.02", "end": "0:11:19.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有必要特地跑这么远吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 158, "start": "0:11:19.61", "end": "0:11:22.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要让我发挥出超能力者的力量"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 159, "start": "0:11:23.32", "end": "0:11:26.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "必须在偶尔出现机会中在的某个特定地点  达到特定的条件才可以"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 160, "start": "0:11:27.14", "end": "0:11:32.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天我们要去的地方  正好满足了这些条件"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 161, "start": "0:11:32.49", "end": "0:11:34.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你还觉得春日是神吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 162, "start": "0:11:35.43", "end": "0:11:38.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你知道「人择原理」这个词吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 163, "start": "0:11:35.43", "end": "0:11:38.28", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（人择原理也称作人类认知原理）"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 164, "start": "0:11:38.64", "end": "0:11:40.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不知道"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 165, "start": "0:11:40.35", "end": "0:11:41.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "简单扼要地说"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:42.20", "end": "0:11:44.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "宇宙之所以会成为这个样子"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:44.75", "end": "0:11:49.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是因为人类对其观测  并开始得知它就是这个样子"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:49.73", "end": "0:11:50.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这样的理论"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:50.95", "end": "0:11:52.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "完全不明白"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:52.78", "end": "0:11:55.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「我们观测了  因此宇宙才存在」"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:56.18", "end": "0:11:57.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也可以这样说吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:58.11", "end": "0:12:01.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  由于世界上有人类这样的智能生命体存在"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 173, "start": "0:12:02.24", "end": "0:12:04.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "发现了物理法则和各种常数"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 174, "start": "0:12:04.98", "end": "0:12:08.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能这样观测宇宙的样子之后"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 175, "start": "0:12:09.04", "end": "0:12:11.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "宇宙本身的存在才被得知"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 176, "start": "0:12:12.16", "end": "0:12:14.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  如果观测宇宙的人类"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 177, "start": "0:12:15.03", "end": "0:12:17.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果没有在地球上进化到这个程度"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 178, "start": "0:12:18.17", "end": "0:12:19.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然没有观测者"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 179, "start": "0:12:20.17", "end": "0:12:23.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "宇宙的存在将不被任何事物所得知"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 180, "start": "0:12:23.34", "end": "0:12:26.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  它存在或不存在将没有任何区别"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 181, "start": "0:12:26.45", "end": "0:12:30.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于有了人类  宇宙才被认识到"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:30.50", "end": "0:12:32.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种人类本位的思想"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:32.41", "end": "0:12:34.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么可能有这种蠢事"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:34.38", "end": "0:12:36.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使没有人类  宇宙也还是宇宙吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:37.01", "end": "0:12:38.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正是如此"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:38.28", "end": "0:12:41.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因此  人择原理也不过是一种假想的理论而已"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:42.19", "end": "0:12:45.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  从这里却可以看出一些有趣的事实"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:46.37", "end": "0:12:50.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么宇宙会被创造成这样适合人类生存的形式呢？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:51.29", "end": "0:12:55.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "引力常数  或者粒子的质量比即使有了细微的不同"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:55.84", "end": "0:12:58.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "宇宙也不会是这样的世界吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:58.86", "end": "0:13:03.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总觉得你这话像是会出现在\n某种披了层科学外衣的奇怪宗教宣传册上的语论啊"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 192, "start": "0:13:03.87", "end": "0:13:11.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过我并不相信有一个全知全能的绝对神是人类的造物主"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 193, "start": "0:13:11.37", "end": "0:13:13.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是在怀疑而已"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 194, "start": "0:13:13.31", "end": "0:13:14.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怀疑什么？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 195, "start": "0:13:14.44", "end": "0:13:20.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们是否只是一些在悬崖边上倒立的小丑而已呢？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 196, "start": "0:13:21.89", "end": "0:13:22.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是开玩笑的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 197, "start": "0:13:23.20", "end": "0:13:26.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说的东西我完全无法理解"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 198, "start": "0:13:26.53", "end": "0:13:29.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "提到人择原理不过是打个比方而已"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 199, "start": "0:13:30.43", "end": "0:13:32.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还没有说到凉宫同学的事呢"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 200, "start": "0:13:32.54", "end": "0:13:35.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以我才想问啊  为什么不论是你  长门还是朝比奈学姐"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:35.87", "end": "0:13:37.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么都这么喜欢春日啊？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:37.70", "end": "0:13:40.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我也觉得她是个很有魅力的人…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:40.56", "end": "0:13:41.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这一点我们先不管它"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:42.39", "end": "0:13:43.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你还记得吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:44.04", "end": "0:13:48.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我曾经说过  世界也许是被凉宫同学创造出来的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:48.68", "end": "0:13:51.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我的记忆中好像的确有这么个令人不快的印象"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:51.96", "end": "0:13:55.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她有实现愿望的能力"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:55.33", "end": "0:13:57.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别这么一本正经地断然说出这种事"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:57.80", "end": "0:14:00.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学一直认为外星人肯定存在"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 210, "start": "0:14:00.87", "end": "0:14:02.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是就希望能够遇到"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 211, "start": "0:14:03.10", "end": "0:14:04.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以长门有希才会在这里"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 212, "start": "0:14:04.96", "end": "0:14:07.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "相同地  她也希望有未来人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 213, "start": "0:14:07.86", "end": "0:14:10.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以朝比奈实玖瑠才会在这里"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 214, "start": "0:14:10.60", "end": "0:14:11.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有我也是"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 215, "start": "0:14:11.97", "end": "0:14:16.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是因为「她希望」这一个理由而在这里的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 216, "start": "0:14:16.24", "end": "0:14:18.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我就想问啊  那你究竟是怎么知道的？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 217, "start": "0:14:19.83", "end": "0:14:21.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是三年前的事情"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 218, "start": "0:14:21.10", "end": "0:14:22.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「三年前」就不用提了！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 219, "start": "0:14:22.61", "end": "0:14:23.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我已经听腻了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 220, "start": "0:14:24.13", "end": "0:14:29.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有一天我突然知道了我有什么力量  怎么使用  以及为什么使用"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 221, "start": "0:14:29.92", "end": "0:14:34.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和我拥有同样力量的人也和我一样觉醒了自己的力量"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:34.75", "end": "0:14:38.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带一提  连「这是由于凉宫春日而得到的」这一点也知道了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:38.85", "end": "0:14:40.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我无法说明是怎么回事"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:40.42", "end": "0:14:42.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只能说「我知道了」"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 225, "start": "0:14:42.81", "end": "0:14:47.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算我退一万亿步  也不觉得春日能做到这一点"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 226, "start": "0:14:47.56", "end": "0:14:49.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也很难以置信"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 227, "start": "0:14:49.85", "end": "0:14:52.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "世界因为一个少女而改变了…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:52.40", "end": "0:14:56.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  也许是正在被她创造呢"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:56.47", "end": "0:14:59.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且  那名少女认为这个世界对于自己来说"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 230, "start": "0:14:59.75", "end": "0:15:01.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是「很无聊的东西」"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 231, "start": "0:15:01.97", "end": "0:15:03.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这就有点恐怖了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 232, "start": "0:15:03.73", "end": "0:15:04.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 233, "start": "0:15:04.76", "end": "0:15:05.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说过吧？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 234, "start": "0:15:05.95", "end": "0:15:07.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既然可以自由地创造世界"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 235, "start": "0:15:08.24", "end": "0:15:12.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么让现在这个世界消失  从头创造一个自己希望的世界就好"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 236, "start": "0:15:13.14", "end": "0:15:16.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样一来  就到了如字面意思一样的「世界末日」了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 237, "start": "0:15:16.76", "end": "0:15:20.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "本来我们连得知这一点的手段都没有"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 238, "start": "0:15:20.40", "end": "0:15:23.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒不如说  我们认为是唯一的这个世界"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 239, "start": "0:15:24.09", "end": "0:15:27.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说不定是经历了很多次重筑的结果"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 240, "start": "0:15:27.54", "end": "0:15:30.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么你就对春日说明自己的真实身份不就好了？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 241, "start": "0:15:30.51", "end": "0:15:33.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果她知道真有超能力者存在一定会很高兴的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 242, "start": "0:15:34.01", "end": "0:15:36.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "估计就不会想要把世界怎么样了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 243, "start": "0:15:36.61", "end": "0:15:38.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过那样也会很糟糕的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 244, "start": "0:15:38.55", "end": "0:15:43.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果让凉宫同学认为超能力是日常生活中普遍存在的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 245, "start": "0:15:43.90", "end": "0:15:46.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "世界就真的会变成那个样子了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 246, "start": "0:15:46.56", "end": "0:15:49.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "物理法则将会完全扭曲"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 247, "start": "0:15:49.29", "end": "0:15:51.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "整个宇宙都会变得一团糟的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 248, "start": "0:15:51.65", "end": "0:15:53.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果是由于春日的愿望你们才会存在"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 249, "start": "0:15:53.85", "end": "0:15:57.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么春日自己没有发现啊？很奇怪吧！"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 250, "start": "0:15:57.70", "end": "0:16:01.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「希望外星人  未来人和超能力者之类存在」的愿望"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 251, "start": "0:16:02.16", "end": "0:16:07.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和「那种东西不可能存在」的常识在凉宫同学心中不断冲突"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 252, "start": "0:16:07.65", "end": "0:16:10.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她的言行的确很离奇"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 253, "start": "0:16:10.46", "end": "0:16:15.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是实际上  凉宫同学是拥有正常思考方式的普通人"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 254, "start": "0:16:17.14", "end": "0:16:19.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "初中时代她宛如沙暴一般的精神"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 255, "start": "0:16:19.96", "end": "0:16:21.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这数个月间格外地平静"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 256, "start": "0:16:22.19", "end": "0:16:25.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我们希望她能够继续地平静下去…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 257, "start": "0:16:25.41", "end": "0:16:28.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是到了这里之后  又卷起了一股龙卷风"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 258, "start": "0:16:29.00", "end": "0:16:29.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 259, "start": "0:16:30.43", "end": "0:16:31.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是因为你哦"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 260, "start": "0:16:31.99", "end": "0:16:33.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我又怎么了？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 261, "start": "0:16:33.77", "end": "0:16:37.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "鼓吹她创建这个稀奇古怪的社团的  就是你"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 262, "start": "0:16:37.60", "end": "0:16:43.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于和你的对话  她才会想要建立一个充满怪人的社团"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 263, "start": "0:16:43.62", "end": "0:16:45.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个责任必须归咎于你"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 264, "start": "0:16:45.74", "end": "0:16:52.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而其结果就是  关心凉宫春日的三个势力的末端得以齐集一堂"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 265, "start": "0:16:53.72", "end": "0:16:54.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…别冤枉我"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 266, "start": "0:16:57.11", "end": "0:17:00.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过呢  的确也不只是这个理由而已"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 267, "start": "0:17:15.48", "end": "0:17:17.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然已经把你带到这里来了…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 268, "start": "0:17:17.74", "end": "0:17:19.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过现在想回头的话还来得及哦"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 269, "start": "0:17:20.00", "end": "0:17:21.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在才说这种话…"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 270, "start": "0:17:22.35", "end": "0:17:24.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能不能请你暂时闭上眼睛呢？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 271, "start": "0:17:25.14", "end": "0:17:26.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要几秒钟就可以了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 272, "start": "0:17:32.05", "end": "0:17:35.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔！…他要干什么啊！真令人恶心"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 273, "start": "0:17:37.71", "end": "0:17:38.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经可以了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 274, "start": "0:17:43.55", "end": "0:17:44.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这里是次元断层的夹缝"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 275, "start": "0:17:45.49", "end": "0:17:47.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是和我们的世界完全隔绝的——"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 276, "start": "0:17:48.06", "end": "0:17:49.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "封闭空间"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 277, "start": "0:17:50.34", "end": "0:17:54.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正好封闭空间的「墙壁」处在这个人行横道的中间"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 278, "start": "0:17:54.64", "end": "0:17:56.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "半径大约5千米"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 279, "start": "0:17:56.70", "end": "0:17:59.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "通常来说  用物理手段无法出入这里"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 280, "start": "0:18:00.43", "end": "0:18:04.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我拥有的力量之一  就是进入这个空间"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 281, "start": "0:18:05.05", "end": "0:18:07.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请想象一下地上产生了一个半球形的空间"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 282, "start": "0:18:08.29", "end": "0:18:09.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这里就是其内部"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 283, "start": "0:18:10.56", "end": "0:18:14.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在在这外面依然是毫无变化的日常生活"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 284, "start": "0:18:15.24", "end": "0:18:19.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "普通人不小心误闯进来…也是极其少见的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 285, "start": "0:18:20.63", "end": "0:18:23.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "封闭空间是完全随机产生的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 286, "start": "0:18:23.98", "end": "0:18:25.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有时一天里会产生好几次"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 287, "start": "0:18:26.29", "end": "0:18:28.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而也有时连续几个月都不会出现"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 288, "start": "0:18:28.84", "end": "0:18:30.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是只有一点是明确的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 289, "start": "0:18:30.50", "end": "0:18:32.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是一旦凉宫同学的精神不稳定"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 290, "start": "0:18:33.11", "end": "0:18:34.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个空间就会出现"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 291, "start": "0:18:35.68", "end": "0:18:38.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可以感测到封闭空间的出现"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 292, "start": "0:18:38.61", "end": "0:18:40.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并可以进入这里"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 293, "start": "0:18:40.41", "end": "0:18:43.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且我的能力还并不止于此"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 294, "start": "0:18:44.47", "end": "0:18:49.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也可以说  我被授予了反映出凉宫同学理性的能力"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 295, "start": "0:18:50.08", "end": "0:18:53.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果说这个世界是从凉宫同学的精神中长出的青春痘"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 296, "start": "0:18:53.69", "end": "0:18:55.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我就是治疗青春痘的特效药"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 297, "start": "0:18:55.98", "end": "0:18:57.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的比喻太难理解了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 298, "start": "0:18:58.28", "end": "0:18:59.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "经常有人这么说"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 299, "start": "0:18:59.75", "end": "0:19:01.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是你也真是了不起"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 300, "start": "0:19:02.23", "end": "0:19:04.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "见到这个情景都几乎没有吃惊呢"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 301, "start": "0:19:04.91", "end": "0:19:06.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为已经发生过很多事了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 302, "start": "0:19:07.23", "end": "0:19:09.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来开始了  请看后面"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 303, "start": "0:19:20.84", "end": "0:19:23.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像是一旦凉宫同学的郁闷心情到了界限"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 304, "start": "0:19:23.48", "end": "0:19:25.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个巨人就会出现"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 305, "start": "0:19:25.87", "end": "0:19:30.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概是在用那样破坏周围事物的方式来发泄压力吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 306, "start": "0:19:30.96", "end": "0:19:33.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为不能在现实世界胡闹"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 307, "start": "0:19:33.67", "end": "0:19:35.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以才创造出封闭空间"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 308, "start": "0:19:35.70", "end": "0:19:38.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只在其内部进行破坏"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 309, "start": "0:19:38.62", "end": "0:19:40.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不觉得她相当地理性吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 310, "start": "0:19:40.91", "end": "0:19:44.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "本来根据物理法则  它由于自身重量连站起来都不可能"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 311, "start": "0:19:44.79", "end": "0:19:47.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不论什么理论都对它不成立"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 312, "start": "0:19:48.05", "end": "0:19:49.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使出动军队"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 313, "start": "0:19:49.90", "end": "0:19:52.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也不可能阻止它吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 314, "start": "0:19:52.30", "end": "0:19:54.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那  就放着它不管由它闹吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 315, "start": "0:19:55.22", "end": "0:19:56.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请看"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 316, "start": "0:19:57.74", "end": "0:19:59.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是我的同事"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 317, "start": "0:19:59.52", "end": "0:20:02.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和我一样被凉宫同学赋予了力量的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 318, "start": "0:20:03.07", "end": "0:20:04.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "巨人狩猎者"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 319, "start": "0:20:04.80", "end": "0:20:06.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我也要去参加了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 320, "start": "0:20:18.75", "end": "0:20:20.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是太荒唐了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 321, "start": "0:20:39.41", "end": "0:20:40.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "久等了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 322, "start": "0:20:41.02", "end": "0:20:43.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最后再给你看一样有趣的事物"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 323, "start": "0:20:44.75", "end": "0:20:46.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有什么？难道比这个还令人吃惊？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 324, "start": "0:20:47.35", "end": "0:20:51.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "伴随着那个怪物被消灭  封闭空间也会同时消失"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 325, "start": "0:20:51.89", "end": "0:20:53.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可是比较壮观呢"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 326, "start": "0:21:07.08", "end": "0:21:08.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你明白了吗？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 327, "start": "0:21:08.69", "end": "0:21:09.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:09.91", "end": "0:21:11.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个蓝色的怪物"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:11.43", "end": "0:21:14.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们称之为神之属族——「神人」"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:14.83", "end": "0:21:18.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "神人和凉宫同学的精神活动相同步"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:18.37", "end": "0:21:20.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并且我们也是这样"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:20.67", "end": "0:21:24.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只有封闭空间产生  神人出现的时候"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 333, "start": "0:21:24.67", "end": "0:21:26.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才能发挥异能之力"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 334, "start": "0:21:27.37", "end": "0:21:30.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且也只能在封闭空间内部使用"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 335, "start": "0:21:30.69", "end": "0:21:33.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比如说  现在的我完全没有任何力量"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 336, "start": "0:21:34.19", "end": "0:21:37.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么只有我们具备这样的力量呢？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 337, "start": "0:21:37.75", "end": "0:21:39.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想大概不论是谁都无所谓吧"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 338, "start": "0:21:39.62", "end": "0:21:41.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们只不过是偶然被选上了而已"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 339, "start": "0:21:43.00", "end": "0:21:46.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不能把神人的活动置之不理"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 340, "start": "0:21:46.57", "end": "0:21:51.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "否则随着神人破坏范围的增大  封闭空间也会增大"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 341, "start": "0:21:51.79", "end": "0:21:55.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才的空间也还是小规模的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 342, "start": "0:21:55.55", "end": "0:21:57.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果置之不理就会逐渐扩大"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 343, "start": "0:21:57.61", "end": "0:21:59.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最后吞没全世界"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 344, "start": "0:22:01.09", "end": "0:22:07.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果变成那样  最后那个灰色的空间将会和我们的世界对调"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 345, "start": "0:22:07.16", "end": "0:22:08.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么你会知道这个？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 346, "start": "0:22:09.28", "end": "0:22:11.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我就是知道  没有办法"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 347, "start": "0:22:12.32", "end": "0:22:15.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们「机关」里的人都是这样"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 348, "start": "0:22:15.79", "end": "0:22:19.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果我们不做些什么的话  世界就一定会毁灭"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 349, "start": "0:22:20.64", "end": "0:22:21.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那就很麻烦了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 350, "start": "0:22:22.97", "end": "0:22:25.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请你注意一下凉宫同学的行为"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 351, "start": "0:22:26.02", "end": "0:22:30.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在她暂时安定下来的精神也渐渐出现了活性化的征兆"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 352, "start": "0:22:30.77", "end": "0:22:32.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天这种状况  我也已经很久没有经历过了"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 353, "start": "0:22:33.19", "end": "0:22:36.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使我注意  不也还是会变成这样吗"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 354, "start": "0:22:36.66", "end": "0:22:38.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个嘛  到底会不会呢？"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 355, "start": "0:22:38.97", "end": "0:22:43.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就我而言  倒是觉得把一切都交给你处理也不错"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 356, "start": "0:22:43.82", "end": "0:22:47.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使在我们之中也是有各种不同想法的"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 357, "start": "0:22:48.29", "end": "0:22:51.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉让我注意春日的行为"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 358, "start": "0:22:51.83", "end": "0:22:54.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然不知道为什么  长门要我「小心」"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 359, "start": "0:22:55.33", "end": "0:22:59.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使如此  我也并不认为马上就会有什么事情发生"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 360, "start": "0:22:59.93", "end": "0:23:01.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果我有预知能力"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 361, "start": "0:23:01.99", "end": "0:23:06.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "知道明天会碰上那种完全不合道理的事情"}
{"ep": "05", "idx": 362, "start": "0:23:06.65", "end": "0:23:09.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "恐怕就不会这么悠闲了吧"}
